# Agent hook wiring (trail rewrites it per checkout with absolute paths, so a
# tracked copy is machine-local and every worktree lane starts dirty). Wave 47
# lane A18 untracked it; Wave 52 lanes P2/P3 re-added it by hand. Keep it
# ignored — scripts/check-hook-paths.mjs is the guard.
.cursor/hooks.json
